WEBVTT

00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:22.405
Here he comes.

00:00:40.485 --> 00:00:42.765
-ZÜNDAPP: What happened?
-I don't know, Professor.

00:00:42.805 --> 00:00:44.965
-What did you do?
-I didn't do nothing.

00:00:45.085 --> 00:00:48.245
Ssh, I'm talking to the Professor.
What's that, Professor?

00:00:48.325 --> 00:00:49.845
-You broke it!
-Quiet!

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:52.325
-I understand, sir. Yes.
-What did he say?

00:00:52.445 --> 00:00:55.325
-We go to the back-up plan.
-Back-up plan?

00:00:55.405 --> 00:00:57.445
We snuck a bomb in McQueen's pit.

00:00:57.765 --> 00:01:01.125
The next time he makes a stop,
instead of saying "ka-chow"...

00:01:01.245 --> 00:01:03.245
he's going to go "ka-boom"!

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:04.965
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:05.085 --> 00:01:07.605
Don't feel bad, tow truck.
You couldn't have saved him.

00:01:07.725 --> 00:01:09.925
Oh, wait, you could have! (LAUGHS)

00:01:09.965 --> 00:01:12.445
-Dad-gum lemons!
-COMPUTER: Request acknowledged.

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.645
What?
You didn't think we'd take your bullets?

00:01:16.765 --> 00:01:18.365
(CACKLING)

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.005
That's right! You got nothing!

00:01:22.045 --> 00:01:24.005
Who's the lemon now, huh?

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:25.845
(MOCKING LAUGHTER)

00:01:26.965 --> 00:01:28.605
Nice try, Mater.

00:01:29.325 --> 00:01:32.805
-Dad-gum... Dad-gum... Dad-gum.
-Request... Request... Request...

00:01:33.565 --> 00:01:35.005
HOLLEY: Mater!

00:01:40.205 --> 00:01:41.965
I got to get y'all out of there.

00:01:42.045 --> 00:01:44.485
There's no time.
McQueen needs your help.

00:01:44.565 --> 00:01:46.845
But I can't. I'm just a tow truck.

00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:49.405
It's up to you.
Go to the pits and get everyone out.

00:01:49.485 --> 00:01:51.965
-You can do that.
-What about you guys?

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:55.485
-We'll be OK.
-Go and get some more dents, Mater.

00:02:04.205 --> 00:02:06.165
HOLLEY: So, we'll be OK? Really?

00:02:06.245 --> 00:02:08.845
He wouldn't have left
if I'd told him the truth.

00:02:08.925 --> 00:02:10.325
Argh!

00:02:10.405 --> 00:02:12.005
Being killed by a clock.

00:02:12.085 --> 00:02:14.845
Gives a whole new meaning to
"Your time has come."

00:02:14.925 --> 00:02:16.925
Time? That's it!

00:02:25.045 --> 00:02:27.725
-What are you doing?
-Trying to turn back time.

00:02:31.245 --> 00:02:34.325
If I can just reverse the polarity.

00:02:37.965 --> 00:02:39.885
Good job. Quick thinking, Holley.

00:02:46.965 --> 00:02:49.885
What's everybody
on the wrong side of the road for?

00:02:51.885 --> 00:02:53.645
HOLLEY: Oh, no!

00:02:53.725 --> 00:02:55.725
Drive! Burn rubber!

00:03:02.445 --> 00:03:04.445
We've got to get to the course.

00:03:05.125 --> 00:03:07.245
Calculate the fastest way to...

00:03:08.765 --> 00:03:09.845
Done.

00:03:09.885 --> 00:03:11.645
Oh. Miss Shiftwell.

00:03:11.725 --> 00:03:15.485
-They're standard issue now.
-You kids get all the good hardware.

00:03:17.405 --> 00:03:20.245
Oh, no, that's Mater's.

00:03:20.325 --> 00:03:21.325
I knew his escape was too easy.

00:03:32.085 --> 00:03:33.485
Come back here! Stop!

00:03:37.205 --> 00:03:39.885
-Mater?
-Everybody, get out now!

00:03:39.925 --> 00:03:42.925
Y'all get out of the pits.
What are you guys doing here?

00:03:42.965 --> 00:03:45.245
-We're here because of you, Mater.
-Is everything OK?

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:47.965
No, everything's not OK.
There's a bomb in here.

00:03:48.085 --> 00:03:50.005
-Y'all got to get out. Now.
-A bomb?

00:03:50.085 --> 00:03:51.565
(COMMUNICATOR BUZZES)

00:03:51.605 --> 00:03:53.725
-FINN: Mater.
-Finn! You're OK.

00:03:53.765 --> 00:03:57.605
Listen to me. The bomb is on you!
They knew you'd try to help McQueen.

00:03:57.765 --> 00:04:01.165
When we were knocked out,
they planted it in your air filter.

00:04:03.565 --> 00:04:06.165
-Uh-oh.
-Mater! There you are!

00:04:06.285 --> 00:04:09.125
-MATER: Stop right there!
-I've been so worried about you.

00:04:09.205 --> 00:04:10.925
MATER: Don't come any closer!
McQUEEN: Are you OK?

00:04:10.965 --> 00:04:12.965
No, I'm not OK! Stay away from me!

00:04:13.765 --> 00:04:15.165
McQUEEN: No, wait! Wait!

00:04:15.285 --> 00:04:19.125
BRENT: A tow truck has just raced
onto the track, driving backwards!

00:04:19.805 --> 00:04:20.965
Mater, wait!

00:04:22.245 --> 00:04:25.125
Normally an emergency vehicle on the
track means there's been an accident.

00:04:25.205 --> 00:04:27.925
-Lightning McQueen is chasing him!
-Mater, wait!

00:04:27.965 --> 00:04:31.805
Stay back! If you get close to me,
you're going to get hurt real bad!

00:04:31.925 --> 00:04:35.805
McQUEEN: I know I made you feel that
way before, but none of that matters!

00:04:35.845 --> 00:04:37.405
We're best friends!

00:04:39.365 --> 00:04:41.085
BRENT: And McQueen
seems to be having

00:04:41.165 --> 00:04:43.005
a conversation with the tow truck.

00:04:43.045 --> 00:04:45.765
DARRELL: I don't know who
that truck is, Brent, but tell you what,

00:04:45.805 --> 00:04:48.205
he's got to be the world's best
backwards driver.

00:04:49.165 --> 00:04:52.165
McQueen, you don't get it!
I'm the bomb!

00:04:52.205 --> 00:04:55.805
Yes, Mater! You are the bomb!
That's what I'm trying to say here!

00:04:55.845 --> 00:04:59.325
You've always been the bomb
and you'll always be the bomb.

00:04:59.405 --> 00:05:01.885
-Stay away!
-No! Never!

00:05:04.165 --> 00:05:05.765
Almost there.

00:05:05.845 --> 00:05:09.645
I'm not letting you get away again!

00:05:10.405 --> 00:05:13.645
-Got to keep away from McQueen!
-COMPUTER: Request acknowledged.

00:05:13.685 --> 00:05:15.565
Oh, my gosh.

00:05:18.005 --> 00:05:19.965
(BLEEPING)

00:05:28.605 --> 00:05:30.605
What is happening? It's a bad dream!

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:34.605
BRENT: And Lightning McQueen
just blasted away,

00:05:34.685 --> 00:05:37.125
hooked to the now rocket-propelled
tow truck.

00:05:39.285 --> 00:05:40.685
Gargh!

00:05:45.245 --> 00:05:47.045
Aagh!

00:05:50.885 --> 00:05:52.445
The Professor's on the run!

00:05:52.525 --> 00:05:55.045
-Someone's got to get McQueen.
-Get McQueen!

00:05:56.525 --> 00:05:59.245
-Holley, I'll get Zündapp. Help Mater.
-Got it!

00:06:03.005 --> 00:06:05.045
What is happening?

00:06:19.085 --> 00:06:20.485
Hurry, Professor.

00:06:32.245 --> 00:06:35.085
You really think I'm going to let you
float away, Professor?

00:06:37.725 --> 00:06:39.165
(STRAINS)

